BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260106-abdc@bitcoinpark.com
DTSTAMP:20260728T174706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T174706Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260106
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260107
SUMMARY:ABDC
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Austin
DESCRIPTION:Austin Bitcoin Design Club meets to improve bitcoin design th
 rough education\, participation\, and good vibes.\n\nIf you can\, bring 
 a laptop for design crit!\n\nThis meetup is a place where we dissect and
  discuss all things UX/UI in the bitcoin and freedom tech ecosystem. We 
 dive deep into existing interfaces\, critique new ideas\, and collaborat
 ively explore solutions to create more intuitive and user-friendly exper
 iences for the next generation of financial freedom tools. Whether you'r
 e a seasoned designer or just curious about how design shapes the future
  of money\, join us to learn\, share\, and contribute to making bitcoin 
 accessible to everyone.\nhttps://www.meetup.com/bitcoin-park-austin/even
 ts/306401268/?eventOrigin=group_events_list
URL:https://www.meetup.com/bitcoin-park-austin/events/306401268/?eventOri
 gin=group_events_list
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260108-austin-bitcoin-club@bitcoinpark.com
DTSTAMP:20260728T174706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T174706Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260108
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260109
SUMMARY:Austin Bitcoin Club
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Austin
DESCRIPTION:Texas has become an epicenter of Bitcoin mining\, where abund
 ant energy meets monetary technology. This panel convenes mining special
 ists to discuss how Bitcoin mining is transforming the energy sector and
  strengthening grid resilience. Hear about projects turning wasted natur
 al gas into Bitcoin (360 Mining’s vertically integrated gas wells) and
  how miners can act as flexible energy buyers\, even returning power to 
 the grid when needed.\nhttps://www.meetup.com/bitcoin-park-austin/events
 /312103453/?eventOrigin=group_events_list
URL:https://www.meetup.com/bitcoin-park-austin/events/312103453/?eventOri
 gin=group_events_list
END:VEVENT
