LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T174706Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260116
SUMMARY:Park 101
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Nashville
DESCRIPTION:Who is this for: This is a beginner level discussion for peop
 le curious or interested to learn about bitcoin. What is Money?\nDiving 
 into the history and features of money. What is Bitcoin and why should I
  care?\nProviding a framework to learn about Bitcoin\, how it works\, an
 d why it has value\nhttps://www.meetup.com/bitcoinpark/events/311846869/
URL:https://www.meetup.com/bitcoinpark/events/311846869/
END:VEVENT
