UID:20260121-telehash-3@bitcoinpark.com
DTSTAMP:20260728T174706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T174706Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260122
SUMMARY:Telehash #3
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Nashville
DESCRIPTION:If you heard about the legendary Telehash fundraiser last yea
 r where the 256 Foundation made history solo mining Bitcoin block #88142
 3 during the live stream\, then you definitely do not want to miss this 
 year's Telehash which is poised to bring more guests\, more hash rate\, 
 and more surprises. Be there as the entire 256 Foundation team makes his
 tory again while showcasing all the open-source Bitcoin mining solutions
  they have developed over the last year.\nhttps://www.meetup.com/bitcoin
 park/events/310818082/?eventOrigin=group_events_list
URL:https://www.meetup.com/bitcoinpark/events/310818082/?eventOrigin=grou
 p_events_list
END:VEVENT
