DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260203
SUMMARY:Nostr Nights #1
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Nashville
DESCRIPTION:Nostr Nights is a quarterly meetup for anyone passionate abou
 t building\, growing\, and exploring the future of decentralized social 
 technology. Whether you're brand-new to Nostr or already building on it\
 , this event is designed to help you learn\, connect\, and go deeper.\nh
 ttps://www.meetup.com/bitcoinpark/events/312318620/
