BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260205-austin-bitcoin-club-fiat-food-fiat-health-bitcoin@bitcoinpar
 k.com
DTSTAMP:20260728T174706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T174706Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260206
SUMMARY:Austin Bitcoin Club: Fiat Food\, Fiat Health\, & Bitcoin
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Austin
DESCRIPTION:True freedom isn't just financial. This panel explores the in
 tersection of Bitcoin\, nutrition\, and healthcare in Austin's community
 . Jimmy Song will moderate this discussion on health sovereignty and Bit
 coin principles. Harry Gray will share the Meat Mafia mission of sparkin
 g a real food renaissance: advocating for nutrient-dense diets\, local r
 anchers\, and breaking free from fiat food system subsidies. Andy Schoon
 over will discuss how CrowdHealth is empowering people to escape legacy 
 health insurance and take charge of medical costs together\, aligned wit
 h Bitcoin's ethos of personal responsibility. From metabolically healthy
  lifestyles to sharing medical bills via Bitcoin\, panelists will highli
 ght how embracing self-sovereignty in what we eat and how we care for ou
 r bodies can lead to better outcomes. Austin is at the forefront of this
  health and wellness movement rooted in freedom tech values.\nhttps://ww
 w.meetup.com/bitcoin-park-austin/events/312103455/?eventOrigin=group_eve
 nts_list
URL:https://www.meetup.com/bitcoin-park-austin/events/312103455/?eventOri
 gin=group_events_list
END:VEVENT
