 itical Economy\, and Philosophy brings together members of the Bitcoin c
 ommunity as well as scholars and graduate students conducting research o
 n Bitcoin to examine the classical liberal foundations and possibilities
  of Bitcoin\, particularly through the principles of liberty and subsidi
 arity.\nhttps://www.meetup.com/bitcoin-park-austin/events/312369055/
URL:https://www.meetup.com/bitcoin-park-austin/events/312369055/
