BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260316-austin-bitcoin-club-hrf-presents-vibe-coding-for-freedom@bit
 coinpark.com
DTSTAMP:20260728T174706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T174706Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260316
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260317
SUMMARY:Austin Bitcoin Club + HRF Presents: VIBE CODING FOR FREEDOM
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Austin
DESCRIPTION:Join Bitcoin Park and the Human Rights Foundation for an even
 ing exploring the intersection of AI and freedom technology during SXSW.
 \nAI is reshaping how software gets built\, and that includes the tools 
 defending human rights around the world. But the same technology powerin
 g open-source development is also fueling surveillance states.\nSo where
  do we go from here?\n\nWe'll hear from HRF on AI-powered surveillance i
 n authoritarian regimes\, then dive into a panel with Justin Moon\, Mark
  Suman\, and Lyle Pratt on how AI is accelerating development on Bitcoin
  and NOSTR\, the privacy trade-offs builders should be aware of\, and ho
 w "vibe coding" is lowering the barrier for anyone to contribute to free
 dom tech.\n\nNo deep technical background required\, just curiosity abou
 t where AI and freedom intersect.\nhttps://www.meetup.com/bitcoin-park-a
 ustin/events/312410911/?eventOrigin=group_events_list
URL:https://www.meetup.com/bitcoin-park-austin/events/312410911/?eventOri
 gin=group_events_list
END:VEVENT
