BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260528-philosophy-for-freedom-in-the-age-of-ai@bitcoinpark.com
DTSTAMP:20260728T174706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T174706Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260528
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260529
SUMMARY:Philosophy for Freedom In the Age of AI
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Nashville
DESCRIPTION:​In the age of AI\, things are changing so quickly that it 
 can feel as though there is no solid ground left to stand on. However\, 
 there seem to be some deeper truths about the nature of reality which re
 main entirely unaffected by technological progress. The purpose of this 
 Meetup is to explore the depths of those paradoxical waters\, and to dis
 cover what solid ground remains.\nhttps://luma.com/dzqnk6lx
URL:https://luma.com/dzqnk6lx
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260530-claws-coffee@bitcoinpark.com
DTSTAMP:20260728T174706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T174706Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260530
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260531
SUMMARY:Claws & Coffee
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Nashville
DESCRIPTION:Claws & Coffee is a casual community gathering focused on AI\
 , automation\, and agent setups. This will have a focus on AI tools incl
 uding Claude Code/Codex\, OpenClaw or alternate agents\, and open source
  best practices. We'll be set up in the back courtyard with cold brew\, 
 hot coffee\, and light pastries. BRING YOUR LAPTOPS\nhttps://luma.com/ir
 anbxr9
URL:https://luma.com/iranbxr9
END:VEVENT
