BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260709-austin-bitcoin-club-presents-building-bitcoin-businesses-for
 -the-long-term@bitcoinpark.com
DTSTAMP:20260728T174706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T174706Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260709
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260710
SUMMARY:Austin Bitcoin Club Presents: Building Bitcoin Businesses for the
  Long Term
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Austin
DESCRIPTION:Building a Bitcoin Businesses for the Long Term. Bitcoin busi
 nesses are built on principles of sound money\, sovereignty\, and decent
 ralization. Yet\, short term optimization\, centralization\, and old fra
 meworks for managing teams\, often influenced by prior experiences and m
 ental models\, can get in the way of our mission to bring more sovereign
 ty and freedom to the world through the advancement of sound money. What
  if there was a better approach that empowered our teams to drive result
 s consistent with the ethos and principles we hold dear?\nhttps://www.me
 etup.com/bitcoin-park-austin/events/312757110/
URL:https://www.meetup.com/bitcoin-park-austin/events/312757110/
END:VEVENT
