BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20261110-abdc@bitcoinpark.com
DTSTAMP:20260728T174706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T174706Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261111
SUMMARY:ABDC
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Austin
DESCRIPTION:Austin Bitcoin Design Club meets to improve bitcoin design th
 rough education\, participation\, and good vibes.\n\nIf you can\, bring 
 a laptop for design crit!\n\nThis meetup is a place where we dissect and
  discuss all things UX/UI in the bitcoin and freedom tech ecosystem. We 
 dive deep into existing interfaces\, critique new ideas\, and collaborat
 ively explore solutions to create more intuitive and user-friendly exper
 iences for the next generation of financial freedom tools. Whether you'r
 e a seasoned designer or just curious about how design shapes the future
  of money\, join us to learn\, share\, and contribute to making bitcoin 
 accessible to everyone.
END:VEVENT
