SUMMARY:NashBitDevs [5-8pm]
LOCATION:Bitcoin Park Nashville
DESCRIPTION:NashBitDevs is inspired by the original BitDevs NYC and simil
 ar meetups to help grow a community in the Nashville area of those inter
 ested in discussing and participating in the research and development of
  Bitcoin and related protocols (i.e. Lightning\, fedimint\, Stratum\, et
 c.) and software. You can be well versed with or new to the topics\, all
  are welcome. Be advised: discussion will be technical.\nhttps://www.mee
 tup.com/bitcoinpark/events/312080213/
URL:https://www.meetup.com/bitcoinpark/events/312080213/
